			],
			"Message": "style(Docs): Replace em dash with hyphen-minus in flavor isolation note\n\nNormalize the em dash (U+2014) in TierGatedImplementationSelection.md to a plain hyphen-minus (U+002D) for consistent rendering across all markdown viewers and to match the project's documentation punctuation conventions.\n\nNo functional change — purely cosmetic normalization of a single character in the flavor isolation paragraph.",
			"SHA": "875f3aa455f0ccfb9623d0b1a1097d69152ec0cf"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-06-12T20:09:44Z",
			"File": [
				"⡿⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				155,
				27
			],
			"Message": "Refactor scripts to improve error handling and output redirection\n\n- Updated various scripts to change output redirection from `>/dev/null 2>&1` to `> /dev/null 2>&1` for consistency and clarity.\n- Ensured that error messages are redirected properly across multiple scripts including `Repository.sh`, `AbsorbGitDirs.sh`, `CommitGraph.sh`, `GarbageCollect.sh`, `PruneRemote.sh`, `Sync.sh`, `Save.sh`, and others.\n- Improved readability of command substitutions and variable assignments by adding spaces around redirection operators.\n- Enhanced error handling in `Transfer/Dependency.sh` and `Transfer/Documentation.sh` to ensure proper checks for command availability and authentication status.\n- Made minor formatting adjustments to maintain consistency across all scripts.\n\nSigned-off-by: Nikola Hristov <Nikola@PlayForm.Cloud>",
			"SHA": "27993e32484bea8467038eaada09b30b887f68cd"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-06-12T20:06:31Z",
			"File": [
				"⡿⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				155,
				27
			],
			"Message": "Refactor scripts to improve error handling and output redirection\n\n- Updated all scripts in the Maintain and Transfer directories to use consistent output redirection style (e.g., `>/dev/null` instead of `> /dev/null`).\n- Ensured that error messages are redirected properly to avoid cluttering the console output.\n- Improved readability and maintainability of scripts by standardizing the way command outputs are handled.\n\nSigned-off-by: Nikola Hristov <Nikola@PlayForm.Cloud>",
			"SHA": "e5c30196d030ffde870918a758586e01f919af41"
